WEBVTT

00:08.830 --> 00:10.570
The city's in view now!

00:11.440 --> 00:17.190
Whoa. That's the Holy City of Shurule?

00:20.540 --> 00:24.790
<b>The Great Cleric</b>

00:21.620 --> 00:24.790
A Salaryman's <b>Path </b>to <b>Surviving Another World</b>

01:49.000 --> 01:53.300
#7 The Holy City of Shurule

01:49.460 --> 01:51.760
So, what's next?

01:51.760 --> 01:53.920
Go straight to the church to pick a fight?

01:54.310 --> 01:57.630
Actually, I'm about out of Substance X.

01:57.630 --> 02:00.970
In that case, off to 
the Adventurers' Guild first?

02:00.970 --> 02:04.320
You all can report in to say
 you've finished escorting me.

02:04.320 --> 02:05.520
Convenient, right?

02:05.520 --> 02:07.350
And what are you <i>really</i> thinking?

02:07.350 --> 02:11.790
I'm worried I'll get picked on at the guild,
 so will you please come with me?

02:12.440 --> 02:14.960
Why don't you go with him, Bazan?

02:14.960 --> 02:16.650
We'll wait here in the carriage.

02:16.650 --> 02:19.720
Tch. Guess I've got no choice.

02:26.280 --> 02:27.990
<i>It's built the same way.</i>

02:27.990 --> 02:29.660
Luciel, over here.

02:30.120 --> 02:32.110
Oh? To reception?

02:32.110 --> 02:34.200
Never mind that. Over here.

02:36.230 --> 02:39.260
Welcome. Did you place an order?

02:36.380 --> 02:39.260
Milty

02:39.260 --> 02:41.080
<i>The cafeteria is the same, too.</i>

02:41.080 --> 02:42.470
Is the master here?

02:42.470 --> 02:44.590
Yes. And you are?

02:44.590 --> 02:46.600
Bazan of Lineage of the White Wolf.

02:46.940 --> 02:52.190
I stopped by to introduce 
Luciel here to the master.

02:52.190 --> 02:53.440
Is that right?

02:53.440 --> 02:57.130
I'll go call him. Would you mind 
waiting here for a moment?

02:57.130 --> 02:58.150
Sure.

03:00.100 --> 03:02.900
Luciel, don't judge a book by its cover.

03:02.900 --> 03:03.870
Huh?

03:03.870 --> 03:08.070
That waitress... She's at least 
as powerful as I am.

03:08.630 --> 03:11.500
Well, look who showed up! If it isn't Bazan!

03:11.500 --> 03:13.830
Master

03:12.100 --> 03:13.830
Been ages.

03:14.850 --> 03:17.590
Yeah. Let me introduce you to my friend here.

03:17.590 --> 03:20.800
My name is Luciel. I'm a healer, actually.

03:23.250 --> 03:26.930
<i>Been a while since I got that reaction. 
I can feel the animosity.</i>

03:27.240 --> 03:29.140
That must mean you're...

03:29.140 --> 03:33.150
Know the guy living at
the Adventurers' Guild in Merratoni?

03:33.150 --> 03:36.420
Huh. So you <i>are</i> Brod's apprentice.

03:36.760 --> 03:39.490
But I bet you're not just here to say hello.

03:39.490 --> 03:41.370
You can place the order yourself.

03:41.370 --> 03:42.210
Okay.

03:42.780 --> 03:45.370
May I order Substance X by the barrel?

03:46.850 --> 03:49.580
Um, would you mind repeating that?

03:49.580 --> 03:52.090
I'd like three large barrels of Substance X.

03:52.090 --> 03:53.070
Three barrels?

03:53.070 --> 03:53.890
Is he magic affiliation?

03:53.890 --> 03:56.200
That stench is enough to scare monsters away!

03:56.200 --> 03:58.050
<i>Do you have to put it like that?</i>

03:58.650 --> 03:59.780
Drink this.

04:00.120 --> 04:03.580
I can't give Substance X 
to people who can't handle it.

04:04.640 --> 04:05.760
All right.

04:11.230 --> 04:12.350
He's a monster!

04:12.350 --> 04:14.990
He must be that super masochistic healer!

04:14.990 --> 04:16.440
I thought he was an urban legend!

04:16.440 --> 04:18.520
<i>I can hear you, you know!</i>

04:20.440 --> 04:21.900
Thanks for the drink!

04:21.900 --> 04:24.060
Now, can I get my order?

04:24.060 --> 04:27.610
F-Fine. As long as you use it responsibly.

04:30.410 --> 04:31.790
All ready for ya.

04:31.790 --> 04:33.410
Thank you very much.

04:33.830 --> 04:35.750
I'll come back when I run out.

04:36.640 --> 04:38.340
Luciel the healer...

04:38.340 --> 04:43.090
Is it true that you treat people
for a mere silver coin?

04:43.440 --> 04:47.350
Everyone at the Adventurers' Guild 
in Merratoni was very good to me.

04:47.750 --> 04:50.890
If nobody gives me trouble here,
 I'll think about it.

04:54.090 --> 04:57.420
Luciel, we're in front 
of church headquarters.

04:57.420 --> 04:58.720
Okay!

05:01.080 --> 05:01.980
<i>This?</i>

05:02.750 --> 05:04.890
It's huge!

05:03.240 --> 05:05.990
Healers' Guild Headquarters

05:06.380 --> 05:08.310
I guess this is the end of our journey.

05:09.210 --> 05:12.540
Yeah. Thank you for bringing me this far.

05:13.790 --> 05:17.480
It's my pleasure to guard
the man who saved my life.

05:17.480 --> 05:20.880
He's right. You saved us, Luciel-kun.

05:22.630 --> 05:27.150
Welp, you better work hard enough to earn
that spell tome you got for free.

05:27.150 --> 05:30.280
I will. R-Really and truly...

05:30.720 --> 05:32.280
Thank you so much!

05:35.200 --> 05:38.140
Next time, I hope we can
grab a drink together!

05:39.210 --> 05:40.230
Yeah.

05:41.700 --> 05:44.940
<i>This sure feels lonely.</i>

05:44.940 --> 05:48.410
<i>Like the first day after being 
transferred to a new office.</i>

05:49.620 --> 05:52.920
<i>That spell tome I got has to be valuable.</i>

05:52.920 --> 05:54.660
<i>I bet it's super expensive.</i>

05:55.010 --> 05:57.950
<i>I'll work hard to repay that favor.</i>

05:57.950 --> 06:00.450
<i>Now then, to church headquarters!</i>

06:00.750 --> 06:05.770
<i>But... what am I supposed
to do now that I'm here?</i>

06:07.280 --> 06:09.180
Excuse me.

06:10.500 --> 06:12.490
<i>It's huge!</i>

06:12.490 --> 06:13.640
Welcome.

06:16.230 --> 06:18.840
This is the Healers' Guild headquarters.

06:18.840 --> 06:20.770
How may we help you today?

06:21.170 --> 06:23.630
My name is Luciel.

06:23.630 --> 06:27.610
On the pope's orders,
I was told to transfer here.

06:28.080 --> 06:31.240
I'd like to speak with 
a supervisor, if possible.

06:31.240 --> 06:33.080
Please wait a moment.

06:34.890 --> 06:38.330
Is that a device that allows
telepathic communication?

06:38.330 --> 06:40.880
You are rather well informed, Luciel-sama.

06:40.880 --> 06:42.290
Oh, not at all!

06:42.290 --> 06:45.800
I just saw something like it 
at the Adventurers' Guild before.

06:45.800 --> 06:48.840
The Adventurers' Guild? Really?

06:48.840 --> 06:53.510
<i>Is it that unusual for a healer 
to go to the Adventurers' Guild?</i>

06:53.840 --> 06:55.730
Ah, here he is.

06:57.850 --> 07:00.120
Are you Luciel-dono?

07:00.120 --> 07:01.910
My name is Granhart.

07:00.890 --> 07:03.900
Granhart

07:01.910 --> 07:03.910
I am a priest here.

07:04.270 --> 07:06.860
I'm also the one who summoned you.

07:06.860 --> 07:08.550
Please come with me.

07:08.550 --> 07:09.840
All right.

07:09.840 --> 07:11.530
Please take care.

07:17.810 --> 07:19.260
<i>An automatic door?</i>

07:19.260 --> 07:20.670
Go in.

07:20.670 --> 07:21.580
Okay.

07:28.550 --> 07:29.640
Whoa.

07:30.340 --> 07:31.970
<i>An elevator?</i>

07:32.310 --> 07:34.460
This is a magical elevating platform.

07:34.460 --> 07:38.400
You can use your magic to activate it
 and move it up or down.

07:38.400 --> 07:41.090
Are there any other entrances?

07:41.090 --> 07:42.630
No, there aren't.

07:42.630 --> 07:48.010
It's said that this was designed 
to prevent outsiders from entering freely.

07:48.010 --> 07:49.570
Is that right?

07:49.620 --> 07:53.240
<i>Was it really to keep people out
 or to keep people in?</i>

08:00.050 --> 08:01.020
What's this?

08:02.070 --> 08:05.540
Aren't you the person I took 
to the Healer's Guild in Merratoni?

08:05.540 --> 08:07.310
<i>Lumina-sama!</i>

08:07.310 --> 08:09.990
<i>I didn't think I'd see her here so soon!</i>

08:09.990 --> 08:13.070
<i>That must be Monster Luck-sensei
at work again!</i>

08:15.480 --> 08:17.120
I believe your name was...

08:17.120 --> 08:18.030
Louis-kun.

08:18.030 --> 08:19.520
Splat!

08:19.520 --> 08:21.750
Now that you're here, Louis-kun...

08:21.750 --> 08:25.650
Lumina-sama, my name is Luciel.

08:26.110 --> 08:29.370
Thank you very much 
for your help in Merratoni.

08:29.370 --> 08:31.820
I'm surprised you recognized me.

08:31.820 --> 08:36.950
Yes, I remembered how crystal clear
your magical aura was.

08:36.950 --> 08:38.480
Did you really?

08:38.480 --> 08:42.250
<i>Magical aura? Maybe she has 
a special skill or something.</i>

08:42.250 --> 08:44.650
I'd like to talk to you about something.

08:48.100 --> 08:52.370
But it looks like you just arrived, 
so just come by my room later.

08:52.370 --> 08:53.720
Is that all right?

08:53.720 --> 08:58.640
Yes, of course. Sorry
to impose, Granhart-dono.

08:58.640 --> 09:03.260
Lumina-sama, you are the captain 
of the Valkyrie paladin regiment.

09:03.260 --> 09:04.850
It's hardly an imposition.

09:05.490 --> 09:07.730
<i>What an awkward vibe.</i>

09:08.180 --> 09:09.920
Well then, see you later.

09:09.920 --> 09:11.310
R-Right.

09:16.410 --> 09:19.450
This looks like a torture chamber.

09:19.450 --> 09:22.210
It's merely a storage room. Don't worry.

09:22.210 --> 09:24.040
A storage room for torture equipment?

09:29.930 --> 09:33.260
Now then, let's get to business.

09:33.900 --> 09:37.760
I was surprised to receive this 
letter from the Merratoni branch.

09:37.760 --> 09:42.160
It claims you provide treatments that
are damaging to other healers' businesses.

09:42.160 --> 09:44.140
I would like to know the truth.

09:44.640 --> 09:49.870
<i>So that's what this is. Granhart-san's 
only trying to get to the bottom of things.</i>

09:49.870 --> 09:52.530
<i>In that case, I have a way to handle this.</i>

09:52.530 --> 09:57.070
<i>I need to think back on what it was like
when I was about to be promoted at work!</i>

09:57.390 --> 09:59.300
In a sense, it is true.

09:59.300 --> 10:01.580
So you admit your crimes?

10:03.140 --> 10:08.000
<i>I told Granhart-san about the problems with 
healers and money that I'd witnessed</i>

10:08.000 --> 10:11.140
<i>in the two years that I was in Merratoni.</i>

10:11.640 --> 10:15.840
<i>As a solution, I proposed making 
treatment fees more transparent</i>

10:15.840 --> 10:18.760
<i>so people could safely
 receive treatment without worry.</i>

10:19.740 --> 10:24.490
Very well. I will discuss this with 
the other priests and the archbishop.

10:24.490 --> 10:26.980
Thank you very much for your understanding.

10:27.300 --> 10:31.280
But then, what exactly 
should I do after this?

10:31.280 --> 10:33.910
Here is your letter of
appointment, Luciel-dono.

10:34.400 --> 10:40.090
You are hereby assigned to the Church
 of St. Shurule's spiritual cleansing unit.

10:40.090 --> 10:43.950
You will be given the position
of both deacon and exorcist.

10:43.950 --> 10:47.420
Huh? Spiritual cleansing unit?

10:45.290 --> 10:48.620
<b>Spiritual cleansing unit?</b>

10:47.410 --> 10:48.620
<b>Exorcist?</b>

10:47.420 --> 10:48.620
Exorcist?

10:48.940 --> 10:54.390
Starting tomorrow, you will work to 
exorcise the undead at a specified location.

10:54.390 --> 10:57.590
Your wages will be
twenty gold coins per month.

10:58.160 --> 11:00.250
<i>Twenty gold coins?!</i>

11:00.250 --> 11:02.290
<i>That's like twenty million yen!</i>

11:02.290 --> 11:03.930
<i>Not per year, but per </i>month<i>?!</i>

11:03.930 --> 11:07.850
You will start tomorrow,
so turn in early tonight.

11:07.850 --> 11:08.980
Yes, sir.

11:08.980 --> 11:12.440
<i>I should've known I'd get 
a promotion at headquarters!</i>

11:12.440 --> 11:14.980
<i>But... am I gonna be okay?</i>

11:18.460 --> 11:20.400
These are Lumina-sama's quarters.

11:20.710 --> 11:22.210
Thank you very much.

11:22.210 --> 11:23.080
Not at all.

11:24.090 --> 11:25.740
I'm kind of nervous.

11:26.730 --> 11:28.330
It's Luciel.

11:28.330 --> 11:29.660
You can come in.

11:34.920 --> 11:38.900
Were you summoned here? 
Or was it a transfer?

11:38.900 --> 11:42.510
I received a letter from the pope 
saying that I would be transferred here.

11:42.510 --> 11:47.580
Getting a letter from Fluna-sama means 
you must be extremely special, Luciel-kun.

11:48.080 --> 11:51.480
I wouldn't call it that. In fact...

11:52.850 --> 11:56.580
I see. So what kind of work 
will you be doing now?

11:56.580 --> 11:59.690
I'm supposed to go exorcise 
the undead somewhere.

12:00.880 --> 12:05.380
Luciel-kun, this new assignment 
might put you in danger.

12:05.380 --> 12:06.370
Huh?

12:06.370 --> 12:09.140
Under the old guild headquarters building,

12:09.140 --> 12:12.130
there's a cemetery where 
the founders are enshrined.

12:12.130 --> 12:15.380
Several decades ago,
it transformed into a labyrinth.

12:15.380 --> 12:20.590
A labyrinth? If magic continues to build 
somewhere it naturally gathers,

12:20.590 --> 12:24.170
it will absorb the desires
and grudges of the living

12:24.170 --> 12:26.220
and begin conjuring monsters and loot.

12:26.220 --> 12:28.310
Oh? You're full of surprises.

12:28.310 --> 12:30.760
I thought you were supposed 
to be totally ignorant.

12:30.760 --> 12:33.890
Well, I did study hard for two whole years.

12:30.770 --> 12:33.890
<b>SMUG</b>

12:33.890 --> 12:35.310
Is that right?

12:35.790 --> 12:39.450
While watching to make sure no 
monsters escape the labyrinth,

12:39.450 --> 12:41.550
you try to thin them out.

12:41.550 --> 12:43.150
That will be your job.

12:43.150 --> 12:45.240
What types of monsters are there?

12:45.240 --> 12:49.170
Undead like skeletons, zombies, and ghosts.

12:49.170 --> 12:51.900
Can I fight those...?

12:51.900 --> 12:56.160
You can wipe them out instantly
 with holy purification spells.

12:56.160 --> 12:59.950
Don't you have considerable
combat training as well, Luciel-kun?

12:59.950 --> 13:02.170
<i>How'd she get intel on me?!</i>

13:02.170 --> 13:06.010
Um, are there any pros to this work?

13:06.760 --> 13:10.090
Anything you gather in the labyrinth is yours.

13:10.090 --> 13:12.270
If you're lucky, you may find treasure.

13:12.630 --> 13:14.550
And if you sell your monster drops,

13:14.550 --> 13:18.650
you can purchase special
exclusive tomes the Church sells.

13:18.650 --> 13:21.730
<i>So there's a way for me 
to get stronger here, too!</i>

13:23.150 --> 13:36.370
<b>Hrrrgh...</b>

13:23.150 --> 13:36.370
<b>Aaah...</b>

13:23.150 --> 13:36.370
<b>Hrrrgh...</b>

13:24.480 --> 13:27.980
But what if I get bit by
a zombie and turn into one?!

13:27.980 --> 13:29.900
The maso-zombie becomes a real zombie...

13:29.900 --> 13:32.020
Wait, who are you calling a maso-zombie?!

13:32.020 --> 13:36.370
They may have poison, but I've never 
heard of anyone turning into a zombie.

13:36.370 --> 13:39.190
I'm relieved to hear that.

13:39.190 --> 13:41.340
Still, there are cons to this work, too.

13:41.920 --> 13:45.590
It smells terrible. Worse yet...

13:44.550 --> 13:49.680
<b>It's the
worst...</b>

13:45.590 --> 13:49.680
The stink sticks to your clothes and people 
give you nasty looks when you get close.

13:49.680 --> 13:51.760
I don't see the problem.

13:51.760 --> 13:53.560
<i>I'm used to that from Substance X.</i>

13:56.560 --> 13:59.560
Oh dear. I'm sorry, but it's getting late.

14:00.610 --> 14:02.820
Thank you very much for today.

14:02.820 --> 14:04.940
I hope we cross paths again soon.

14:04.940 --> 14:07.540
Indeed. I hope we do as well.

14:11.400 --> 14:15.870
<i>Now I know why I was sent to the Holy City
 and what I'm meant to do here.</i>

14:15.870 --> 14:18.560
<i>So I'll keep it up, just like when</i>

14:19.080 --> 14:22.590
<i>I was reincarnated 
and found my way to Merratoni.</i>

14:22.590 --> 14:25.120
<i>I'll do whatever I can
to survive in this world.</i>

14:27.360 --> 14:28.720
Good morning.

14:28.720 --> 14:30.930
It looks like you finally made it.

14:30.930 --> 14:34.260
I must have kept you waiting. 
Please accept my apologies.

14:34.260 --> 14:39.810
Oh, it's all right. I'm sure Granhart-sama 
didn't tell you what time to come anyway.

14:36.180 --> 14:39.810
Jord

14:41.740 --> 14:44.190
Nice to meet you. I'm Jord.

14:44.190 --> 14:46.600
I'm your predecessor here.

14:46.600 --> 14:49.150
I'm Luciel. It's nice to meet you.

14:49.150 --> 14:51.160
First, you need to take this.

14:52.690 --> 14:53.620
What is it?

14:53.620 --> 14:56.660
A robe given to healers and 
knights here at headquarters

14:54.780 --> 15:03.880
<b>Rank A or Above</b>

14:56.660 --> 14:58.830
who hold rank A or above.

14:58.830 --> 15:03.470
It is specially sewn with holy 
silver threads that ward off miasma.

14:58.830 --> 15:03.880
<b>Wards Off Miasma</b>

15:00.170 --> 15:03.880
<b>Holy Silver Threads</b>

15:03.470 --> 15:05.250
Sounds expensive.

15:05.250 --> 15:06.900
It costs ten platinum coins.

15:05.300 --> 15:09.130
<b><i>10 Platinum Coins!!</i></b>

15:06.900 --> 15:09.130
<i>That's like one billion yen!</i>

15:09.130 --> 15:11.220
I'll also give you this.

15:11.680 --> 15:15.810
With this, you won't need my permission 
to use the magic elevating platform.

15:15.810 --> 15:17.310
You can even go outside.

15:17.310 --> 15:21.340
Really? Thank you so... much?

15:21.340 --> 15:22.400
What?

15:22.400 --> 15:25.830
I have to give it to you 
because I'm short on time,

15:25.830 --> 15:29.770
but you had best not
cause any trouble. Understood?

15:30.150 --> 15:33.630
If you go out, you may not bring
anyone back to headquarters.

15:33.630 --> 15:36.950
Not invalids, not children, not pets.

15:36.950 --> 15:39.330
Swear it, or I won't hand this over.

15:39.330 --> 15:41.610
<i>That's a lot of stingy details.</i>

15:41.610 --> 15:43.870
<i>But it's not like I have a choice.</i>

15:44.200 --> 15:45.590
I swear it.

15:45.590 --> 15:46.460
Good.

15:47.610 --> 15:51.680
Jord and I shall be your witnesses.

15:52.990 --> 15:54.230
What was that?

15:54.230 --> 15:55.500
A vow.

15:55.810 --> 15:59.920
If you break your promise, you will 
no longer be able to use the card.

15:59.920 --> 16:04.160
There will also be penalties,
so you'd best be careful.

16:04.160 --> 16:07.940
Penalties?! Is that what 
the torture chamber is for?

16:09.190 --> 16:10.440
<b>TOR</b>

16:09.440 --> 16:10.440
<b>TURE</b>

16:10.440 --> 16:14.030
The Church's penalties are unusually strict.

16:14.030 --> 16:15.870
Got it.

16:15.870 --> 16:18.240
Jord, you can handle the rest.

16:18.240 --> 16:19.580
All right.

16:22.290 --> 16:24.370
Well, let's head to the labyrinth.

16:24.370 --> 16:26.370
But one thing first.

16:26.880 --> 16:28.820
You should put that robe on.

16:28.820 --> 16:29.740
Okay!

16:33.720 --> 16:36.490
Here we are. This is the labyrinth entrance.

16:41.730 --> 16:44.850
<b>Pew</b>

16:42.090 --> 16:44.850
<i>Ugh! She wasn't kidding. It reeks.</i>

16:44.850 --> 16:49.520
<b>Pew</b>

16:45.290 --> 16:49.530
<i>It smells like rotting flesh.
Still better than Substance X, though.</i>

16:49.840 --> 16:51.960
The monsters come up from underground.

16:51.960 --> 16:53.160
I see.

16:53.570 --> 16:54.610
Here's one.

16:54.610 --> 16:57.910
<i>Wow, we've hit our first zombie!</i>

16:57.910 --> 16:59.830
<i>I've seen them in movies and stuff!</i>

16:59.830 --> 17:02.050
<i>This is the real thing!</i>

17:02.050 --> 17:03.390
Just watch for now.

17:03.390 --> 17:04.460
Okay.

17:04.990 --> 17:08.870
O holy touch of healing.
O breath of the mother of this great land.

17:09.330 --> 17:13.110
I beseech you, protect our bodies from harm

17:13.470 --> 17:18.050
and return these unclean beings 
to the path from whence they came.

17:18.050 --> 17:19.560
Purification!

17:23.190 --> 17:27.900
And that's how it's done. This'll be
your job starting today, Luciel-kun.

17:27.900 --> 17:30.490
The undead are drawn to the living.

17:30.490 --> 17:35.210
When one gets close, use the holy spell
purification to exorcise them.

17:35.210 --> 17:38.040
And this is a magical stone. 
Collect them in your satchel.

17:38.040 --> 17:38.950
Okay!

17:38.950 --> 17:44.020
<i>Purification is a new spell 
I learned after leaving Merratoni.</i>

17:44.020 --> 17:48.320
<i>It's versatile magic that dispels impurity 
and curses. It also cleans things.</i>

17:48.320 --> 17:51.000
<i>It can even get the grime 
out of your lunch box.</i>

17:49.000 --> 17:51.000
<b>It even sanitizes!</b>

17:51.000 --> 17:55.810
But what would you have done 
if I couldn't use purification?

17:55.810 --> 17:58.260
You would have had to learn it on the job.

17:58.260 --> 18:01.470
So anyway, good luck. Man, it reeks!

18:02.710 --> 18:05.760
Huh? Running from the stench...

18:05.760 --> 18:08.690
Oh well. Just gotta try to stay safe.

18:11.360 --> 18:16.440
The weapons Master Brod put in my magical 
bag are already coming in handy!

18:16.440 --> 18:19.090
All right! Time to exterminate zombies!

18:21.270 --> 18:25.620
I'm all ready to go, 
but I'm not finding any zombies.

18:27.220 --> 18:29.830
I guess I should start mapping.

18:29.830 --> 18:33.500
Like on graph paper.
I might get lost otherwise.

18:38.550 --> 18:40.760
Oh my Lord! Oh my Buddha! Oh my ancestors!

18:40.760 --> 18:43.680
O holy touch of healing.
O breath of the mother of this great land.

18:43.680 --> 18:46.680
I beseech you, protect our bodies from harm

18:46.680 --> 18:50.150
and return these unclean beings 
to the path from whence they came.

18:50.150 --> 18:52.030
Puri— Purifi—

18:52.030 --> 18:54.680
Purification!

19:03.230 --> 19:05.800
I accidentally cast it three times at once.

19:05.800 --> 19:09.260
Man, real zombies are seriously scary!

19:09.960 --> 19:14.330
Oh, that's right! I defeated some 
monsters, so I bet my level...

19:13.790 --> 19:16.130
<b>Job: Healer</b>

19:13.790 --> 19:16.130
<b>Age: 17</b>

19:13.790 --> 19:16.130
<b>Level: 1</b>

19:14.330 --> 19:15.510
hasn't gone up.

19:16.130 --> 19:20.120
Or is this labyrinth just 
an illusion? A training area?

19:20.120 --> 19:21.760
Is this how they haze newcomers here?

19:23.710 --> 19:24.550
But still...

19:24.550 --> 19:31.010
<i>For twenty million a month, I'll dive in 
head first and use this place to train.</i>

19:31.010 --> 19:33.570
<i>If my level happens to go up, even better.</i>

19:33.570 --> 19:37.280
<i>But there's a limit to the number 
of times I can cast purification.</i>

19:38.780 --> 19:41.290
Magical sword... purification!

19:42.890 --> 19:46.740
<i>All that did was put the spell on my blade,</i>

19:47.630 --> 19:48.950
<i>but if I whack a zombie now,</i>

19:48.950 --> 19:52.710
<i>it should only use up 
one or two MP when I do.</i>

19:54.560 --> 19:57.920
<i>If I don't overdo it, I should 
recover that much right away.</i>

19:59.650 --> 20:02.760
And I'm getting in sword training. 
Two birds with one stone!

20:06.260 --> 20:09.150
<i>This is nothing compared 
to Master's training!</i>

20:09.150 --> 20:11.410
<i>It feels like they're standing still.</i>

20:11.410 --> 20:14.100
<i>Nobody can stop me now!</i>

20:14.720 --> 20:18.230
Say, speaking of the undead, I wonder...

20:18.230 --> 20:19.290
Heal!

20:21.360 --> 20:26.240
I knew it! Using recovery magic 
on the undead actually damages them.

20:26.240 --> 20:29.920
Wait, that reeks! Purification!

20:31.550 --> 20:36.330
Okay. I've covered most of the first level.

20:36.330 --> 20:40.420
Guess that means I'm on to the second!

20:41.760 --> 20:44.300
<b>Aaah...</b>

20:41.760 --> 20:44.300
<b>Rrrgh...</b>

20:42.090 --> 20:44.300
<b>Labyrinth, Second Level</b>

20:44.810 --> 20:47.760
<i>Yay! Monsters right from the start!</i>

20:47.760 --> 20:50.570
<i>Now if I could just get some treasure,
this would be like</i>

20:50.570 --> 20:53.650
<i>the fantasy version
of a test of courage for new hires.</i>

20:54.750 --> 20:58.190
<i>Is that what they call a will-o'-wisp?</i>

21:01.690 --> 21:02.570
It's so weak!

21:04.570 --> 21:07.660
At this rate, the second 
level should be a breeze.

21:07.660 --> 21:09.810
<b>GRUMBLE</b>

21:10.240 --> 21:12.540
Maybe it's time for lunch.

21:14.890 --> 21:16.860
A sandwich!

21:16.860 --> 21:19.710
And Substance X...

21:21.670 --> 21:27.310
I guess Gulgar-san has a quota to meet,
but I just can't get away from Substance X.

21:32.910 --> 21:37.480
Actually, thanks to this, the stench 
of the labyrinth doesn't bother me.

21:37.480 --> 21:40.980
Also, the monsters aren't attacking.

21:40.980 --> 21:44.160
Even though Jord said they 
were drawn to the living.

21:46.720 --> 21:51.070
<i>So, the second level was like the first.</i>

21:51.070 --> 21:56.540
<i>Figuring I wouldn't get lost, I headed 
to the third and kept exploring.</i>

22:00.880 --> 22:02.670
<b>A mob of skeletons appears</b>

22:02.670 --> 22:04.830
Purification! Purification!

22:05.150 --> 22:07.180
Purification!

22:13.140 --> 22:14.930
<b>Out of magic</b>

22:17.040 --> 22:21.860
<i>And that's how, without too much trouble, 
I finished my first day of exploring.</i>

22:22.820 --> 22:24.360
Let's call it a day!

23:55.700 --> 23:57.010
Torture devices?

23:55.950 --> 23:57.540
<b>BLAH BLAH BLAH</b>

23:57.010 --> 23:59.760
Oh. I'm just keeping them 
in the storage room.

23:59.760 --> 24:03.330
What reason would I have to use them 
at the Healers' Guild headquarters?!

24:03.330 --> 24:05.080
Next time: "A Threat in the Boss Room."

24:05.080 --> 24:09.210
I think I know how to,
but I just don't use them at all.

24:05.880 --> 24:09.880
#8 A Threat in the Boss Room
